 engagement of PECAM-1 with PLC-gamma 1 may lead to PLC-gamma 1 activation and subsequent calcium influx.", "literatureReference": [210132], "className": "Summation", "schemaClass": "Summation"}], "reviewStatus": {"dbId": 9821382, "displayName": "five stars", "definition": "externally reviewed", "name": ["five stars"], "className": "ReviewStatus", "schemaClass": "ReviewStatus"}, "category": "binding", "input": [{"dbId": 210007, "displayName": "p-Y663,Y686-PECAM1(27-?) [plasma membrane]", "stId": "R-HSA-210007", "stIdVersion": "R-HSA-210007.1", "maxDepth": 1, "name": ["p-Y663,Y686-PECAM1(27-?)", "phosphorylated PECAM-1", "p-CD31 antigen"], "speciesName": "Homo sapiens", "consumedByEvent": [210283], "species": 48887, "endCoordinate": -1, "referenceType": "ReferenceGeneProduct", "startCoordinate": 27, "className": "Protein", "inDisease": false, "schemaClass": "EntityWithAccessionedSequence"}, {"dbId": 202320, "displayName": "PLCG1 [cytosol]", "stId": "R-HSA-202320", "stIdVersion": "R-HSA-202320.1", "maxDepth": 1, "name": ["PLCG1", "Phospholipase C gamma 1", "PLC gamma 1", "PLC1"], "speciesName": "Homo sapiens", "consumedByEvent": [210283], "species": 48887, "endCoordinate": 1290, "referenceType": "ReferenceGeneProduct", "startCoordinate": 2, "className": "Protein", "inDisease": false, "schemaClass": "EntityWithAccessionedSequence"}], "output": [{"dbId": 210240, "displayName": "PECAM-1:PLC gamma1 complex [plasma membrane]", "stId": "R-HSA-210240", "stIdVersion": "R-HSA-210240.1", "maxDepth": 2, "name": ["PECAM-1:PLC gamma1 complex"], "speciesName": "Homo sapiens", "producedByEvent": [210283], "species": [48887], "inDisease": false, "schemaClass": "Complex", "className": "Complex"}], "className": "Reaction", "schemaClass": "Reaction"}